[0.011, "o", "\u001b]11;?\u001b\\\u001b[6n"]
[19.338, "o", "**Milwaukee M18** is the main platform, at about 15 tools: table saw, circular saw, Hackzall, 16″ chainsaw and pole saw, compact router, cut-out tool, random orbit sander, multi-tool, drill, impact driver, brad nailer, heat gun, 2 gal wet/dry vac and ROCKET tower light (the tower light is unconfirmed; the miter saw is listed as gone).\r\nM12 has only the 2″ planer and the rotary tool. Ryobi 18V has just the hot glue gun, and EGO 56V lists no tools. Most M18 tools were bought bare, and the battery count is unknown: [owner] thinks there's one 8.0 Ah HIGH OUTPUT pack, meant for the table saw.\r\n"]
